# swarm-death.vrs: swarm D16's death run. spider-swarm's wave 1 is killed (6 kills), then a spider kills Chaos (.devdie,
# the nearest CHAR_Spider_Forest as the killer); an admin stop shows "1 players, 6 kills, 1 deaths, winner K/D 6.00" and
# "Spider swarm winner: Chaos, K/D 6.00 (6 kills, 1 deaths)". Runs after swarm.vrs (spider-swarm exists and is enabled);
# the death drops inventory items at the spot and the respawn is a held space.
# Needs: IncludeAdmins = true; no purge cooldown (wait 60 s after swarm.vrs's purge); NyarDevTools (.devdie).
ensure
# the home spot is in sun by day, and a death resets invulnerability: set it before TPHome (Session 1, 2026-10-11)
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
mark
chat .nyar event start spider-swarm
expect-log event spider-swarm wave 1/5: 6 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
chat .devkill -581295882 50
chat .devkill 2136899683 50
chat .devkill 2103131615 50
wait 3
chat .devkill -581295882 50
chat .devkill 2136899683 50
chat .devkill 2103131615 50
expect-log event spider-swarm wave 1 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event spider-swarm wave 2/5: 9 units queued timeout=20
wait 10
chat .devdie -581295882 50
expect-log \[DEV DIE\] found=1
wait 5
shot full sw-dead
chat .nyar event stop spider-swarm
expect-log event spider-swarm scoreboard: 1 players, 6 kills, 1 deaths, winner K/D 6\.00
expect-chat Spider swarm winner: Chaos, K/D 6.00 timeout=20
shot chat sw-dead-winner
hold space 1.5
wait 10
shot full sw-respawned
